          "settings": {
            "subheading": "SPANISH DOWN FROM KAWADA FEATHER"
          }
        },
        "qp_lead_head": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Spanish down from Kawada Feather, supplied for NANGA",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "qp_lead_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kawada Feather has supplied NANGA with down ever since we launched as a down products brand. Founded in 1891, Kawada Feather set its own down testing standards and rigorous quality control at a time when there were no international quality standards for down. For 30 years it has backed the quality of NANGA products, and now that NANGA is one of Japan's leading down brands, the two companies continue to push for even higher quality together.</p><p>The duck down NANGA uses today is premium Spanish down from a farm under joint contract with Kawada Feather. Down from waterfowl raised with care for their environment and growing period is imported, then washed and refined at Kawada's factory in Japan using techniques developed over many years before it goes into our products.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "qp_lead_sub",
        "qp_lead_head",
        "qp_lead_text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/knowledge-philosophy-ducks.jpg",
        "image_link": "",
        "full_width": false,
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
