    "qp_clean1": {
      "type": "split-content",
      "blocks": {
        "qp_c1_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>High-quality down needs more than loft. It also has to be clean. Only when it's both can it deliver warmth and release moisture properly. Raw down contains dust, dirt, and other impurities, and Kawada Feather's factory, the largest of its kind in Japan, removes nearly all of them to bring out the down's performance.</p><p>Before any washing, the raw down is dedusted to remove fine debris, oxidized oils, and sand. Next, it's washed in large drum machines with ultra-soft water and a down-specific detergent. It's then dried quickly at 140–150°C (284–302°F), cooled, dedusted again, and sorted. Every machine in the process is Kawada Feather's own design, built on know-how developed over more than a century.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "qp_c1_text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/knowledge-philosophy-farm.jpg",
        "image_link": "",
        "full_width": false,
        "image_position": "right",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
    "qp_clean2": {
      "type": "split-content",
      "blocks": {
        "qp_c2_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The washing stage stands out. Complex water currents rub the down clusters against each other, removing every kind of dirt without damaging the down. Two washes and four rinses help it reach a cleanliness (transparency) rating of 2,000 mm, far above European standards and the shipping standards set by the U.S. and Japanese industries.</p><p>That's why down refined by Kawada Feather is clean and odor-free, so you can feel the down's natural performance.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "qp_c2_text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/knowledge-philosophy-clean-down.jpg",
        "image_link": "",
        "full_width": false,
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
