    "qp_duck1": {
      "type": "split-content",
      "blocks": {
        "qp_d1_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most down sold in the apparel industry today comes from Pekin ducks raised in China. The duck down in NANGA products comes from Mulard ducks raised in Spain, which have more barbs and longer barbules. The result is dense down with large down clusters.</p><p>The farm under joint contract with Kawada Feather and NANGA is on the eastern side of the Pyrenees, on the border between France and Spain. Big swings between day and night temperatures make the birds hardy, yielding high quality both as meat and in their by-product, down. The farm is also off the migration routes of wild birds, so there's less risk of disease, which helps keep supply stable.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "qp_d1_text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/knowledge-philosophy-flock.jpg",
        "image_link": "",
        "full_width": false,
        "image_position": "right",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
    "qp_duck2": {
      "type": "split-content",
      "blocks": {
        "qp_d2_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Modern facilities, a clean environment, and free-range grazing on wide-open land are part of the secret to strong, high-quality down. So is a much longer growing period.</p><p>Much Chinese down comes from young birds raised for less than 40 days, while these Spanish farms raise their birds for 80 days or more, something only about 10% of farms worldwide do. The result is down with excellent resilience and loft.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "qp_d2_text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/knowledge-spanish-down-farm-visit.jpg",
        "image_link": "",
        "full_width": false,
        "image_position": "left",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "color_scheme": "default"
      }
    },
